else_and_equals.plain, line 2: Write "is" instead of "==".

    if x == 3
         ^^
Try this:
    if x is 3
Why: "==" comes from other languages. Plain compares with "is" and "is not", as in: if score is 10

else_and_equals.plain, line 4: Write "otherwise" instead.

    else
    ^^^^
Try this:
    otherwise
Why: "else" on its own comes from other languages. Plain says "otherwise".

